@prefix sh:    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl:   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

# The software module's validation surface (five-facet orthogonality, Commit/Release/
# Repository/Blob/TreeEntry/Diff/Merge well-formedness) is authored entirely as logic: core
# content in slices/extensions/software/module.ttl and projected to
# generated/shapes/validation-shapes.ttl. This file carries no hand-authored sh:NodeShape:
# every check is a canonical logic: constraint or an EL-safe OWL/RDFS axiom whose SHACL image
# the pipeline derives. The file is retained (not deleted) as the stable, intentionally
# shape-free anchor for the software validation namespace.
